---
// Craft.astro
// "Made Different" section — homemade spices & authentic craft story
// Appears after the Marquee, before OilTruth
---

<section class="craft-section" id="craft">
  <div class="craft-inner">

    <!-- Left: heading + story -->
    <div class="craft-left">
      <div class="craft-tag">
        <span>✦</span> Crafted Differently
      </div>
      <h2 class="craft-hl">
        Market brands buy their spices.<br/>
        <em>We grind ours at home.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="craft-body">
        Every major namkeen brand you know sources pre-mixed, industrial masala from a
        packet — the same packet used by dozens of other companies. The flavor is
        <strong>standardised, not crafted.</strong>
      </p>
      <p class="craft-body">
        At Hariram Namkeen, our spice blends are ground fresh in our own kitchen —
        the same way it has been done for generations in Muzaffarnagar. No shortcuts.
        No outsourced masala. <em>Just real spices, real hands, real taste.</em>
      </p>

      <div class="craft-differentiators">
        <div class="craft-diff-item">
          <div class="craft-diff-icon">🌶️</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Fresh-ground masala</strong>
            <span>Spices ground in-house daily, never from packets</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="craft-diff-item">
          <div class="craft-diff-icon">🫙</div>
          <div>
            <strong>No industrial shortcuts</strong>
            <span>We reject pre-mixed blends used by mass brands</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="craft-diff-item">
          <div class="craft-diff-icon">🧑‍🍳</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Generations of craft</strong>
            <span>Recipes passed down, not copied from a competitor</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: quote + a standalone trust fact -->
    <div class="craft-right">

      <div class="craft-quote">
        <span class="craft-quote-mark">"</span>
        Premium does not mean expensive packaging —
        it means <em>nothing fake inside the packet.</em>
        <span class="craft-quote-attr">— Hariram Namkeen</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
